# AUTO-JOIN REQUIREMENTS
# DISCORD_TOKEN must belong to the SAME Discord Application as the website DISCORD_CLIENT_ID.
# Battalion Clerk must already be in GUILD_ID, have MANAGE_ROLES, and its role must sit above every role it manages.
# Enable the Discord Developer Portal Server Members Intent because onboarding/role reconciliation reads guild members.
# The Website requests identify + guilds.join from applicants and holds the user grant securely until approval.

